{
  "version": "0.6.5",
  "publishedAt": "2026-09-23T04:11:48+03:00",
  "notes": [
    "Adds a 1\u20137 day selector for LIVE comparison in the Minion Calculator; the selected window changes the calculation, sorting and labels.",
    "Adds customizable Minion table columns with persistence and reusable saved views.",
    "Moves reliable-history depth into a separate bubble beside LIVE with a detailed reliability dialog.",
    "Measures reliable-history depth from actual stored snapshot continuity instead of requiring a complete 7-day window.",
    "Adds a compact data diagnostics dialog for market freshness and local-history status.",
    "Adds sync-import duplicate protection and duplicate counters for retransmitted snapshots.",
    "Prevents stale browser JS/CSS after updates with no-store headers and versioned Minion assets."
  ],
